\fs22\b PocketDesk 1.0.0\b0\par
\par
PocketDesk is a desktop organization layer for Windows.\par
\par
- Files placed in a normal box are moved into the app data directory and restored to their original location when removed.\par
- Mapped boxes only store path references and never modify the source files.\par
- Application data is stored in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\PocketDesk.\par
- Uninstalling the MSI keeps application data by default.\par
